Package: ivDiag
Title: Estimation and Diagnostic Tools for Instrumental Variables Designs
Version: 1.0.7.9000
Date: 2026-10-30
Authors@R: c(
  person("Apoorva", "Lal", , "lal.apoorva@gmail.com", c("aut"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3697-614X")),
  person("Yiqing", "Xu", , "yiqingxu@stanford.edu", c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2041-6671"))  
  )
Description: Estimation and diagnostic tools for instrumental variables designs
    with one endogenous treatment, implementing the guidelines in Lal, Lockhart, Xu,
    and Zu (2024) <doi:10.1017/pan.2024.2>. The package reports ordinary least
    squares and two-stage least squares estimates with analytic and bootstrapped
    confidence intervals, several first-stage F statistics including the effective F
    statistic, the Anderson-Rubin test and its confidence set, the tF procedure of
    Lee, McCrary, Moreira, and Porter (2022) <doi:10.1257/aer.20211063>, and
    local-to-zero sensitivity tests. It also supports fuzzy regression discontinuity
    designs.
URL: https://yiqingxu.org/packages/ivDiag/
